{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43585","headline":"赠劒客李园联句 · 孟郊","name":"赠劒客李园联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天地有灵术，得之者惟君。\n筑炉地区外，积火烧氛氲。\n照海铄幽怪，满空歊异氛。\n山磨电奕奕，水淬龙蝹蝹。\n太一装以宝，列仙篆其文。\n可用慑百神，岂惟壮三军。\n有时幽匣吟，忽似深潭闻。\n风胡久已死，此劒将谁分。\n行当献天子，然後致殊勳。\n岂知丰城下，空有斗间云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}